；兩者都是農產的產銷通路，合為一則；「年輕人樂於從事務農工作」是預期效果","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":327},{"end":10,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-016-020:2","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.institutional-design"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.time-bank"]},"id":"10-016-020-2-001","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-016-020-2-p1","quote":"推動時間銀行制度","reason":"主張推動時間銀行制度；「拉近人與人的關係」是預期效果","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":2},{"end":40,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-016-020:2","fields":{"action":["action.develop"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.tourism"]},"id":"10-016-020-2-002","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-016-020-2-p1","quote":"改變思維拓展觀光，開發時尚旅遊資源","reason":"主張開發新的旅遊資源以拓展觀光","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":23},{"end":61,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-016-020:2","fields":{"action":["action.improve"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.streetscape"]},"id":"10-016-020-2-003","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-016-020-2-p1","quote":"營造特色環境美學，打造宜居生活空間","reason":"主張營造具特色的環境景觀；原文沒有寫出做法，工具寫 -","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":44},{"end":82,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-016-020:2","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.cultural-heritage"]},"id":"10-016-020-2-004","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-016-020-2-p1","quote":"發揚傳統廟宇文化，保存宗教文物資產","reason":"主張發揚廟宇文化並保存宗教文物；兩者都是廟宇的文化資產，合為一則；原文沒有寫出做法，工具寫 -","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":65},{"end":103,"entity":"2022-township-mayor:10-016-020:2","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.farmers","beneficiary.fishers"],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.industrial-policy"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.agri-marketing"]},"id":"10-016-020-2-005","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-016-020-2-p1","quote":"行銷特有農漁產品，提升農漁民的收入","reason":"主張行銷在地特有的農漁產品，提高農漁民收入；比照行銷農漁特產的既有寫法，工具寫產業政策","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":86}],"manifest":{"data_version":"dcc91c853f2e","election":"2022-township-mayor","format":"policy-atlas-dataset-scope","format_version":1,"scope":"2022-township-mayor:10-016-020"},"mappings":[{"allocation":1.0,"claim":"10-016-020-1-001","evidence":"推動單項運動再深化：由棒球、桌球進化到羽球、游泳，聘請專業教練施教","facet":"culture.sports.athletes","id":"10-016-020-1-001-m1","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.culture.sports.athletes","question_version":1,"reason":"原文提出增加培育競技運動人才的經費與資源的具體做法，判為強烈支持","review_status":"未經獨立複評","stance":"stance.strongly-support","stance_value":2.0},{"allocation":1.0,"claim":"10-016-020-1-002","evidence":"成立專屬獎學金，鼓勵移訓在外就讀的傑出學子","facet":"culture.sports.athletes","id":"10-016-020-1-002-m1","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.culture.sports.athletes","question_version":1,"reason":"原文提出增加培育競技運動人才的經費與資源的具體做法，判為強烈支持","review_status":"未經獨立複評","stance":"stance.strongly-support","stance_value":2.0},{"allocation":1.0,"claim":"10-016-020-1-003","evidence":"落實雙語教育：鄉內國中小推動雙語教育","facet":"education.bilingual","id":"10-016-020-1-003-m1","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.education.bilingual","question_version":1,"reason":"原文提出推動各級學校的雙語教育的具體做法，判為強烈支持","review_status":"未經獨立複評","stance":"stance.strongly-support","stance_value":2.0},{"allocation":1.0,"claim":"10-016-020-1-004","evidence":"普及社區長者共餐：（不再侷限少數村莊，每星期一至星期五供應長者午餐","facet":"ageing.inclusion","id":"10-016-020-1-004-m1","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.